	(536, 574, 'mitigate', NULL, NULL, 'planned', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-05 15:04:52.659', '2026-02-05 15:04:54.553163', 3, 789, '### How to Prevent
- Implement differential privacy during training.
- Limit access to raw confidence scores in model predictions.
